# Blog Images Directory

This directory contains featured images for blog posts.

## File Naming Convention
- Images should be named with the blog post slug: `{slug}.{extension}`
- Example: `what-is-youtube-automation.jpg`

## Supported Formats
- PNG
- JPG/JPEG
- WebP

## Recommended Dimensions
- Width: 1200px
- Height: 675px  
- Aspect Ratio: 16:9 (matches aspect-video class used in blog components)

## Alternative Sizes
- Small: 800x450px (16:9)
- Medium: 1200x675px (16:9) - Recommended
- Large: 1600x900px (16:9)
